ALGORITHM SumOfDigits
INPUT: n
OUTPUT: digit_sum

STEP 1: SET digit_sum == 0
STEP 2: SET num == n
STEP 3: WHILE num > 0 DO
STEP 4:     SET digit_sum == digit_sum + num % 10
STEP 5:     SET num == num // 10
STEP 6: END WHILE
STEP 7: DISPLAY "Sum of digits:"
STEP 8: DISPLAY digit_sum
STEP 9: RETURN digit_sum

END ALGORITHM
